{"type":"message","id":"861f0a5b","parentId":"25418b05","timestamp":"2026-04-13T21:00:23.841Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the results:\n\n1. **OpenClaw**: Update available - npm version 2026.4.12 is available. The current install is via pnpm and on the stable channel.\n\n2. **Skills**: All global skills are up to date.\n\nSince there IS an update available for OpenClaw, I need to:\n- Note that Sam should be notified on Telegram\n- Provide the update details\n\nLet me prepare a plain text summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## OpenClaw Daily Update Check Summary\n\n**Checked:** Tuesday, April 14, 2026 - 6:00 AM (Asia/Seoul)\n\n### Updates Available\n\n**OpenClaw Core:**\n- Status: ✅ Update available\n- Current Install: pnpm (stable channel)\n- Available Version: npm 2026.4.12\n- Action Required: Run `openclaw update` to install\n\n**Skills:**\n- Status: ✅ All up to date\n- 1 global skill checked (simplemem-skill) - no updates needed\n\n### Notification Required\n\n⚠️ **Updates detected for OpenClaw**\n\nSam should be notified on Telegram with the following message:\n\n---\n\nOpenClaw Update Available\n\nAn update to OpenClaw core is ready:\n\n• Version: npm 2026.4.12\n• Current: pnpm stable channel\n• To install: Run `openclaw update`\n\nAll skills are current.\n\n---"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":217,"output":389,"cacheRead":19528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20134,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776114017944,"responseId":"202604140500195bf85b04b1c24897"}}
